      "writtenOn": "2023-10-26T02:10:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "W/o this padding addition, the bounds passed to the Vello render operation would not actually include the rightmost/bottom-most pixels that were expected to be zero-initialized by the clear. \n\nIf due to resetting the atlas, those padding pixels had previously been set to a non-zero value for an old mask entry, inverse fills would clamp to the wrong coverage value. After fixing this I could not reproduce the issues that Arman showed in chat.",
