      "writtenOn": "2023-10-26T02:10:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This fixes the banding that was showing up in the `complexclip` family of GMs. We need to clamp to the texel center of the padding to ensure we hit a 0 coverage value for inverse fills, vs. clamping to the boundary between a possibly-non-zero mask value and the padding.",
